  },
  {
   "id": "X3",
   "rule": "Nature Level (Eps 18-185) vs Adept Realm (171+): both render source Xiantian. VERIFY via source alignment, then unify to 'Adept Realm' (incl. 'Innate Realm' leaks and 'Nature Spirit' check) OR document as era terms if verification shows distinct source tiers"
  },
  {
   "id": "X4",
